Guix build sandbox workaround: disable ghostty's SIMD code path to keep the
libghostty-vt target compatible with the baseline CPU used by zig build.
Regenerated against ghostel 0.46.0 (zig 0.16 API).

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Guix-specific build environment]

--- a/build.zig
+++ b/build.zig
@@ -27,6 +27,7 @@
     const ghostty_dep = b.dependency("ghostty", .{
         .target = target,
         .optimize = ghostty_optimize,
+        .simd = false,
         .@"emit-lib-vt" = true,
     });
 
